  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a medium bowl, whisk together flour, sugar, cocoa powder, and salt.",
    "Add the melted butter and stir until the mixture forms a crumbly mixture.",
    "Press the mixture into the bottom of a 9x9-inch baking dish.",
    "Arrange the sliced apples on top of the crust.",
    "Drizzle the caramel sauce over the apples.",
    "Sprinkle the toffee bits over the top.",
    "Bake for 35-40 minutes or until the apples are tender and the topping is golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for 10 minutes before serving."
